<title>USA: Vanguard Air completes private placement. [CORRECTED 19:35 GMT 11/9]</title>
<headline>Vanguard Air completes private placement. [CORRECTED 19:35 GMT 11/9]</headline>
<dateline>KANSAS CITY, Mo. 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Vanguard Airlines Inc said Tuesday it completed a $7.3 million (corrects from $5.2 million) private placement of units of securities, each unit consisting of the company's common stock and a redeemable common stock purchase warrant.</p>
<p>The company said it satisfied requirements outlined by the Nasdaq Stock Market and believes Nasdaq will grant it continued listing on the Nasdaq SmallCap Market.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
